{"server":"tw","storyId":"act37side_level_act37side_08_beg","groupId":"act37side","stageId":"act37side_08","title":"戰火重鑄之劍","storyCode":"GO-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act37side/level_act37side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"795172da37f1405af045425368b0378c76e19920becbe48352007c71555908ab","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>奧克特里格區前線T1陣地</><p=2>1098年10月2日 6:23 A.M. 戰爭結束日</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡……在盡頭……等待……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗長……凝視……死亡，凝視……你們……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，目標已清除！但我們的彈藥大概只能再撐兩分鐘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請指示下一步行動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小隊全員，準備迎接白刃戰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撐過最後的兩分鐘，我會掩護你們撤退！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，我們的火力支援快要用盡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火力轟炸區預計三分鐘後停止轟炸！你那邊的戰況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者的濃霧完全驅散不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"工人們開闢出的補給線被那些鬼東西完全切斷了，戰略物資無法及時送達你們的陣地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們做好撤出T1陣地的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！如果我們讓出T1陣地，聯軍的包圍線就會從我們這裡被突破！隊長，我無法接受——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰場不是逞能的地方！服從命令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經向羅德島的其他人發送求援訊號，現在只能相信博士他們的安排了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"士兵，我們已經回到家了，先活下來！然後再把失去的一切奪回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，我們會死守陣地最後兩分鐘，然後撤回去支援你們，清理濃霧裡的怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛，保護好他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到，隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果確認濃霧無法驅散，別管我們，立刻撤往I12區域，和高多汀的一零六突擊炮旅會合，繼續戰鬥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就待會再見了，隊長——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊中的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（詭異的嚎叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心，推進之王！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是赦罪師的那些奇美拉怪物……全員準備撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊中的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吟唱般的鳴叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它把自己點燃了！漢娜，小心它身上的火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"痛、好痛……維娜，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其他人快撤！我不能再接受任何無謂的犧牲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊中的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（淒厲的哀嚎）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等——這些援軍是哪裡來的？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"未知來源的訊號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反巫術炮命中，目標行動已被干擾。剩餘小隊繼續架設反巫術炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"未知來源的訊號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行動目標：清除濃霧中的威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"未知來源的訊號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"T1陣地友軍請注意，繼續堅守陣地，緊急戰略補給將於三分半後抵達你們的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"典範軍T1陣地作戰小隊收到！請報上你們的部隊番號！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"未知來源的訊號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"諾曼底公爵麾下擲彈團第八營奉命前來支援典範軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"諾曼底公爵？擲彈團第八營？號角小姐，你知道這支部隊的來歷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不是諾曼底公爵的直屬部隊，而是隸屬於馬奇伯爵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是出身軍事世家，斯卡曼德羅斯中尉對我們的情報資訊果然瞭如指掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，保護好亞歷山德莉娜殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於殿下您，就收下我這份小小的禮物吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，等這些麻煩事結束後，我會親自登門拜訪的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，你認識馬奇伯爵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們從來沒見過。但在一些送來給我的消息裡，提到過她的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在沒時間管這些了！有了援軍的幫助，我們應該能重新打通補給線！號角小姐，我們很快就能會合了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，終於到了徹底了結這一切的時候了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群在歡呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"narration","text":"她望向遠方的碎片大廈以及依稀可見的聖王會西部大堂，內心前所未有的冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三角鐵、大提琴、雙簧管……風暴突擊隊的各位，請看著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一定會親手驅散倫蒂尼姆的陰霾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"典範軍T1陣地作戰小隊全體聽令，堅守陣地，一步不退！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“收到！！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g4_ordnancefactory"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>海布里區工人秘密基地</><p=2>1098年10月2日 6:36 A.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，洛克十八把通道最後一段路的掃描圖上傳到PRTS了，你有收到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到了！洛洛，我們已經在維修最後一個變軌節點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以目前的損壞程度來看，還需要多久才能完全修復？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"十分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶他們的位置確認了嗎？我們必須儘快取回那件武器，典範軍在前線需要我們的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還在嘗試定位正確位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天我們找到的全是他們留下的誘餌信標，想要恢復聯絡恐怕還需要一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那至少證明奶奶他們暫時還是安全的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我是說如果……如果我們無法聯絡上凱瑟琳女士，接下來該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"利用這條通道，把海布里區剩餘的物資盡可能運送到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——大家都還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些薩卡茲是從哪裡突然冒出來的……還有剛才那聲炮擊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"煙霧流動，然而深處仍有一道火星閃爍，明亮……\n那是煙頭上的火光。\n費斯特聞到了一股熟悉而嗆鼻的味道，他的眼角忍不住微微泛酸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就說，你一忙起來總是忘了注意背後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，歡迎回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，我們一直在找你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，有人通知我們說地下通道正在被維修時，我就已經猜到是你們了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他看到了煙霧深處的巨大黑影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，還記得你當初留下的改造圖紙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然在薩卡茲的封鎖下費了一番功夫，但你設計的那個大塊頭，我們終於還是把它造出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“爬行號”……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>薩迪恩區地下密道</><p=2>1098年10月2日 6:39 A.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的耳飾變得很……溫熱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔，剛才那些工人來支援那群自救軍，也是你傳遞的消息吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，你會嚇到我的“朋友”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小貓，不過還是謝謝你替我保管了小石榴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也辛苦你替我清理掉那些杜卡雷留下的礙眼石頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，還你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有很多的事情要忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又要去找你的那個“鐵皮”朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他……不會想錯過這一戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你之前救了我。後會無期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來呢，你又要去哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去見他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不去幫凱爾希勛爵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有阿米婭和Logos他們護著，她不會有事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會先行一步，在聖王會西部大堂地下等著他們。我查到他最後出現的地方就是那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殿下已經離世，當年的事……該有個了結了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你的傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來你不必再參與正面戰場的事，保護好自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙，你還不清楚我的能耐嗎？當年你從我們這裡偷學的東西可不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"引你進城已經是我所能做到的極限了。你們與攝政王之間的事，“玫瑰河畔”不會再參與。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續追查那位的下落。當年她在最後關頭突然拋下殿下消失，總得給個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之中消息靈通的那位姐妹查到了她離開倫蒂尼姆後一直向西走，但目的地還不確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？把她帶回來，還是殺了她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她欠所有河畔航船一個解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你還是先操心自己吧，攝政王就在眼前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們河畔航船彼此承諾不再介入與巴別塔有關的事，但幫幫老朋友應該不算違規吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一抹血，是祝福，也是饋贈。少點疼痛，少留些疤痕，一路順風，阿斯卡綸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……非要抹在脖子上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰叫你總喜歡用帽兜把臉遮得嚴嚴實實的，這樣看起來更漂亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，忘記問了，你覺得那隻小貓如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風中傳來隱匿在陰影裡的聲音。\n“無需我評價。一切塵埃落定，自有定論。”\n“我們都一樣。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>直到今天，仍然有人爭論那場戰爭究竟是在何時結束的。</i>\n\\n<i>有人說是食腐者之王倒下於聖王會西部大堂門前的那一刻，也有人認為是薩卡茲大軍徹底撤出倫蒂尼姆的時候。</i>\n\\n<i>身為親歷者，自然也不乏人詢問我的看法。</i>\n<i>幸好，我的答案與維娜完全一致——</i>\n\\n<i>當我們鼓起勇氣接過維娜手中的那柄劍並親手揮向食腐者之王時，戰爭就已經結束了。</i>\n\\n<i>反抗，並親手摧毀那個帶來災厄的敵人——我們從來不需要某位特定的英雄。</i>\n<i>那一戰，每一位為了家園與未來而奮戰的人，都是英雄。</i>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i09_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"“所有人！不論你的番號是什麼，來自哪支部隊，效忠哪位公爵——”\n“現在，沒有後退的選擇！”\n“協助聯軍！我們憑什麼落在這些傢伙後面！”\n“來人，支援典範軍！”\n“隊長，嘶——我的武器壞了——”\n“拿我的！壞了就換一把！沒了？那就搶魔族佬的刀繼續打！！”\n“推進！推進！！”\n“為了維多利亞——”\n“為了維多利亞！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i09_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"士兵，你不該空手繼續衝鋒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿著這把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……可、可是這是諸王之息……我……不能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是……屬於你的劍，殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，它屬於維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在“榮光”號的殘骸之上，這把劍經歷了許多我所信賴的人之手，最終傳到了我這裡，完成了它的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，拿著它！傳遞給每一個能夠握緊它的人，讓它繼續完成自己的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這同樣是維多利亞人的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我們拿走了劍，那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還有手裡的錘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不會停下，我會和你們一起戰鬥到最後。"},{"type":"narration","text":"清晨的曙光穿破烏雲，金髮的菲林與維多利亞人並肩而立。\n士兵緊握著劍，她望向那個眼神堅毅的阿斯蘭，炙熱的陽光刺眼。\n但她卻捨不得移開目光……她看到了千千萬萬與她並肩作戰的維多利亞人——\n她看到了國王，與她的子民同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"遵命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聯軍第六縱隊第十步兵團，所有還活著的人，繼續跟著我前進！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了維多利亞！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"願廣闊的大地庇佑吾王！♪"},{"type":"narration","text":"士兵手中的劍，斬殺了兩名食腐者王庭軍與一名術師，劍身上留下了兩道深深的缺口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"庇佑他的子民與他的福祉！♪"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而，她的傷太重了，已經無法再前行。於是，她將劍傳遞出去。\n接過劍繼續戰鬥的是一名工人，他與一名王庭軍精英同歸於盡，而劍身上又添了一道劃痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"賜予我們無盡的恩典！♪"},{"type":"narration","text":"從血泊之中撿起劍的是一名響應號召而加入戰鬥的感染者市民。她沒有擊敗任何敵人，卻緊緊護住了這把劍——\n守護著她的維多利亞，守護著希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們歡樂地歌唱！♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安·韋伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞，我的故鄉！♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>最終，那柄劍刺入了食腐者之王的身體，隨後消失在混亂的戰場之中。</i>\n\\n<i>至今，沒有人知道最後握住這把劍的英雄是誰，也不知道他是否還活著……但這把劍確實完成了它的使命——</i>\n\\n<i>由維多利亞人親手揮向了侵略者。</i>\n<i>然而它的傳奇並未結束。據說，工人們在血泊與泥濘中找回了那把已經殘破不堪的“諸王之息”……</i>\n\\n<i>後來的故事，每一個倫蒂尼姆的孩子都能朗朗上口地唱誦。</i>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g9_dusklentiavenue_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>奧克特里格區，食腐者的最後陣地</><p=2>1098年10月2日 7:35 A.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不到食腐者了……結束了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這些噁心的濃霧一點也沒有散開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對勁，那些薩卡茲不像之前那樣趁著濃霧發動進攻。這是陷阱嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據我們過去與食腐者軍隊交手的經驗，他們遠比我們想像中的更難纏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角小姐，按照你的判斷，我們現在該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"配合聯軍大部隊的行動，暫緩前進，在局勢完全明朗之前，減少無謂的傷亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我們聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達，麻煩把命令傳達給所有同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去同步給聯軍總指揮部，還有可露希爾他們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來源未知的訊息","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，喂，喂——你確定帽兜人給的通訊頻段組是對的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來源未知的訊息","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？已經接通了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來源未知的訊息","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，所有人聽好了，巴別塔已經奪下軍委會的指揮中心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來源未知的訊息","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那幫混蛋現在一團亂，根本沒空去支援食腐者那個老東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來源未知的訊息","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們這群膽小鬼別在那裡浪費時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來源未知的訊息","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點結束這一切吧，相不相信隨便你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來源未知的訊息","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"順帶一提，記得抬頭看看天上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來源未知的訊息","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……老女人這下欠我一個大人情了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在檢查訊號的頻段，不同頻段幾乎同時收到了這段通訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯軍和薩卡茲應該都能聽到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說話那個人的聲音，是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維什戴爾。看來他們也沒閒著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角小姐，請重新評估一下情況——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，看天上！那是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人抬頭望向天空，隨即，一陣震耳欲聾的蒸汽噴發聲響徹聖王會西部大堂的上空。\n“維多利亞！”\n維多利亞軍隊的士氣瞬間沸騰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是查爾斯·林奇！他衝進濃霧裡了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我能聽到裡面的動靜，他正在和食腐者戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然大家現在士氣高昂，但聯軍的大部隊還沒有動作。很明顯那些公爵還在猶豫……畢竟他們沒理由這麼輕易就相信一條來源不明的情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然羅德島選擇相信維什戴爾他們，我也選擇相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我們也相信你，推進之王。我會通知所有人整備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，什麼情況——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有沒有聽到那個聲音……就在我們腳底下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"典範軍的各位，我們終於見面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，維娜，我沒看錯吧——有個大……大東西從地底下鑽出來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大東西？不，它可是有名字的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“爬行號”，是我孫子設計的，還不錯吧？"},{"type":"narration","text":"灰白頭髮的駕駛員吐出一口煙圈，自豪地站在龐然大物的梯子上。\n它擁有四條巨大的蒸汽液壓腿部裝置，全身包覆著厚重且極具工業風格的防護裝甲。\n漆黑的炮管仍然冒著縷縷青煙——剛剛就是它轟開了地面。\n而“爬行號”的身下的空洞裡正不斷湧出自救軍的士兵，他們搬運著戰備物資走上地面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王小姐，幸好我們趕上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，自救軍會加入你們的行動。有奶奶他們的幫助，我們的勝算會大大提升！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們剛剛也收到那段通訊，看來時機正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"號角小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，準備完畢了，隨時可以行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，這就是最後一戰了。我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍等，還有一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我調整一下炮管……嗯，這樣就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，摀住耳朵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"炮火擊中了奧克特里格區中央那座歷經漫長歲月的大鐘。\n鐘聲悠揚響起，迴盪在戰場的每一個角落。隨之而來的是聯軍部隊此起彼落的衝鋒號角聲與嘹亮的吶喊聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總得讓某些人知道，我們已經到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來就交給你指揮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——維多利亞人，向著最後的勝利，前進！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
